# Not RCAN's specification. This file binds one edge, json/rfc8785, to the `canonical`
# operation of the driver protocol in github.com/craigm26/regen-rcan-assurance (SPEC § 2.5:
# the canonical bytes of input.value, as base64; a value with no canonical form gets an error).
# With it, `tilth run` sends the edge's pack to any implementation or adapter that speaks that
# protocol. There is no oracle here: the pack is the whole check.
tilth 0.1

spec rcan-canonical 0.1
  title "RCAN canonical JSON, as rcan-assurance reads RCAN v3.2 Appendix C"

op canonical
  input value any
  result the canonical bytes of `value`, base64

edge json/rfc8785 via canonical value base64
edge number-text/ecmascript via canonical value base64
